# Font: Inter only

- Font family: always `var(--font-sans)` — never write `font-family: 'Inter'` inline
- Loaded weights: **300** and **400** only — 500/600/700/800/900 are not loaded
- Base size: `13px`. All rem scale from this: xs=0.75rem · sm=0.875rem · base=1rem · lg=1.125rem · xl=1.25rem · 2xl=1.5rem
- Figma shows Roboto — ignore it. Translate: 12px→text-xs · 14px→text-sm · 16px→text-lg · 18px→text-xl

```tsx
// ✅
<p className="text-sm font-medium" />         // 0.875rem, weight 400
<span className="text-xs font-light" />       // 0.75rem, weight 300

// ⛔
<p style={{ fontFamily: 'Inter', fontSize: '14px' }} />
<p className="font-bold" />                   // still renders as 400 — misleading
```
